<title>USA: Levitz sees profits ahead of plan.</title>
<headline>Levitz sees profits ahead of plan.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Levitz Furniture Inc said on Thursday that for the month of November profit margins were slightly below plan, but better than last year -- and when combined with continued strong expense controls, would produce operating profit ahead of plan.</p>
<p>The company said that in November sales increases were strong across the country. Every product line was up over last year, reflecting continued customer acceptance of its product line-up and the effectiveness of new marketing programs, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
